 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"d88d23d0-564f-458e-becb-10bb20ad50c8"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "process-specific pruning."
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"c4f75951-23db-4e5f-95d6-cadab29289b2"],
 "\nSo your code is more of a brute-force verifier, while MadGraph is a \
constrained generator. \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
